"entity": {
"name": "Gestamp Automocion S.A.",
"description": "Gestamp Automoci\u00f3n SA is a holding company, which engages in the provision of advisory and financing services. It also designs, develops, and manufactures components for the automobile manufacturers. The company operates in Western Europe, Eastern Europe, North America, Mercosur, and Asia. The firm offers body, external, and structural parts for vehicle bodies; suspension arms and axles; and body components, powered systems, and driver controls for mechanism. The company was founded by Francisco Jos\u00e9 Riberas Mera on December 22, 1997 and is headquartered in Madrid, Spain.",
